# Generative AI for Beginners (Microsoft)

Microsoft's official 18-lesson course on generative AI. Covers: prompt engineering, RAG, LLM fundamentals, agents, evaluation, responsible AI, and applied use cases.

Tier: Secondary (practitioner — Microsoft-authored course material)
Category: GitHub Repos
Author: Microsoft
Date: 2026-07-26

## Notes

The agent should fetch the README via `gh api` for the lesson index and structure. This is a strong secondary source — Microsoft-authored, well-structured, covers the same concept surface as the AbdullahAbuHassann course but from a different angle (more enterprise/applied framing). Useful for cross-referencing concept nodes #7 (prompting), #8 (RAG), #9 (fine-tuning), #11-14 (evals), #20 (ai-safety).
